 of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll. If your unit is below Starting Strength, add 1 to the Wound roll as well.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="hammer-of-avernii-dominator-beacon" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;alternatives&quot;:[{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;,&quot;DREADNOUGHT&quot;]},{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;,&quot;TERMINATOR&quot;]},{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-bladeguard-veteran-squad&quot;,&quot;unit-sternguard-veteran-squad&quot;,&quot;unit-vanguard-veteran-squad&quot;]}]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;detachment-army-restricted-to-iron-hands&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-dominator-beacon">DOMINATOR BEACON</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One Adeptus Astartes Dreadnought, Terminator, Bladeguard Veteran Squad, Sternguard Veteran Squad or Vanguard Veteran Squad unit from your army within range of an objective marker you control.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>That objective marker remains under your control, even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at the end of a phase.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="hammer-of-avernii-cogitated-ferocity" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;alternatives&quot;:[{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quot;ADEPTUS ASTARTES&quot;,&quot;DREADNOUGHT&quot;]},{&quot;allKeywords&quot;:[&quo