-scout-squad&quot;]}]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="space-marines-stratagem-cloaked-position">CLOAKED POSITION</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Start of your opponent’s Movement phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One friendly unengaged PHOBOS/SCOUT SQUAD unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit has -3&quot; detection range until the end of the turn.</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="vanguard-spearhead" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Vanguard Spearhead</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"></div></section>
